{"id":"n76639-1-9","stage":5,"title":"중시 · 重视","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76639-1-9-1","ko":"우리나라는 현재 과학 기술 중시 풍조에 따라 과학 기술 분야에만 많은 지원금이 투입되고 있어.","zh":"我们国家目前由于重视科学技术的风气，大量资金都投入到了科技领域。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라는","meaning":"我们国家，我国","explanation":"우리나라：我们国家，我国；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70403","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리나라는","audio":"/audio/949e1162304fbf074af6.mp3"}},{"text":"현재","meaning":"现在，目前，此时","explanation":"현재：现在，目前，此时。","readings":[{"term":"현재","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62446","senseId":"1","lemma":"현재","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"현재","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3"}},{"text":"과학","meaning":"科学","explanation":"과학：科学。","readings":[{"term":"과학","audio":"/audio/b494fc31b2909926f2c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21353","senseId":"2","lemma":"과학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과학","audio":"/audio/b494fc31b2909926f2c2.mp3"}},{"text":"기술","meaning":"技术","explanation":"기술：技术。","readings":[{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73355","senseId":"1","lemma":"기술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}},{"text":"중시","meaning":"重视","explanation":"중시：重视。","readings":[{"term":"중시","audio":"/audio/91eba5501e00c023d33f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76639","senseId":"1","lemma":"중시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중시","audio":"/audio/91eba5501e00c023d33f.mp3"}},{"text":"풍조에","meaning":"潮流，浪潮，风气","explanation":"풍조：潮流，浪潮，风气；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"풍조","audio":"/audio/8af2c39d83b36411047c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84465","senseId":"2","lemma":"풍조","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풍조에","audio":"/audio/9d45c2e9fd70b8ae5285.mp3"}},{"text":"따라","meaning":"随着","explanation":"따르다：随着；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"9","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따라","audio":"/audio/b3d3c74efc47a457e176.mp3"}},{"text":"과학","meaning":"科学","explanation":"과학：科学。","readings":[{"term":"과학","audio":"/audio/b494fc31b2909926f2c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21353","senseId":"2","lemma":"과학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과학","audio":"/audio/b494fc31b2909926f2c2.mp3"}},{"text":"기술","meaning":"技术","explanation":"기술：技术。","readings":[{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73355","senseId":"1","lemma":"기술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기술","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3"}},{"text":"분야에만","meaning":"领域，方面","explanation":"분야：领域，方面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"분야","audio":"/audio/1f797b0c3d05100af080.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21113","senseId":"1","lemma":"분야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분야에만","audio":"/audio/36353eb446f8bb463123.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"지원금이","meaning":"援款，援助金","explanation":"지원금：援款，援助金；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지원금","audio":"/audio/72394bb0f83fc437d372.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76868","senseId":"1","lemma":"지원금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지원금이","audio":"/audio/2304630596c325bb8c6a.mp3"}},{"text":"투입되고","meaning":"投入，投放，花费","explanation":"투입되다：投入，投放，花费；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"투입되다","audio":"/audio/e047124e02c920d6b72a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81613","senseId":"2","lemma":"투입되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"투입되고","audio":"/audio/047a3204127a63020dd9.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c32807440d40f0d8","term":"우리나라","zh":"我们国家，我国","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3","entryId":"70403","definition":"韩国人用于指称自己的国家。","pronunciation":["우리나라"]},{"id":"72d2bae2a744d54f","term":"현재","zh":"现在，目前，此时","audio":"/audio/72d2bae2a744d54f0940.mp3","entryId":"62446","definition":"现在这个时候。","pronunciation":["현ː재"]},{"id":"b494fc31b2909926","term":"과학","zh":"科学","audio":"/audio/b494fc31b2909926f2c2.mp3","entryId":"21353","definition":"探明自然界和人类社会的真理或法则的学问。","pronunciation":["과학"]},{"id":"a78cee47656be418","term":"기술","zh":"技术","audio":"/audio/a78cee47656be418e747.mp3","entryId":"73355","definition":"将科学理论应用到实际中，使其对人类生活有用的手段。","pronunciation":["기술"]},{"id":"91eba5501e00c023","term":"중시","zh":"重视","audio":"/audio/91eba5501e00c023d33f.mp3","entryId":"76639","definition":"认为十分重大而重要。","pronunciation":["중ː시"]},{"id":"8af2c39d83b36411","term":"풍조","zh":"潮流，浪潮，风气","audio":"/audio/8af2c39d83b36411047c.mp3","entryId":"84465","definition":"随着时代而改变的世态或状况。","pronunciation":["풍조"]},{"id":"3ad4e3c6c1e70dee","term":"따르다","zh":"随着","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3","entryId":"64547","definition":"与某对象成比例。","pronunciation":["따르다"]},{"id":"1f797b0c3d05100a","term":"분야","zh":"领域，方面","audio":"/audio/1f797b0c3d05100af080.mp3","entryId":"21113","definition":"根据一定标准将社会活动划分而成的范围或部分之一。","pronunciation":["부냐"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"72394bb0f83fc437","term":"지원금","zh":"援款，援助金","audio":"/audio/72394bb0f83fc437d372.mp3","entryId":"76868","definition":"为帮助他人做得更好或摆脱困境而给的钱。","pronunciation":["지원금"]},{"id":"e047124e02c920d6","term":"투입되다","zh":"投入，投放，花费","audio":"/audio/e047124e02c920d6b72a.mp3","entryId":"81613","definition":"人手、物品或钱财等被用到必要的地方。","pronunciation":["투입뙤다","투입뛔다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b4ea23476b4a4d93583.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76639-1-9-2","ko":"다른 순수 학문을 하는 사람들에게도 지원을 해 주었으면 좋겠는데 말이지.","zh":"我觉得也应该给从事其他纯学术研究的人提供一些支持啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的。","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}},{"text":"순수","meaning":"纯正，纯粹","explanation":"순수：纯正，纯粹。","readings":[{"term":"순수","audio":"/audio/0a721569f0975a60da82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15795","senseId":"1","lemma":"순수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"순수","audio":"/audio/0a721569f0975a60da82.mp3"}},{"text":"학문을","meaning":"做学问，学问，学识","explanation":"학문：做学问，学问，学识；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학문","audio":"/audio/efd39504d3c7a69fdd27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84269","senseId":"1","lemma":"학문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학문을","audio":"/audio/6ecbe49d2ff3fe829907.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들에게도","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들에게도","audio":"/audio/444e09502a4acae607b2.mp3"}},{"text":"지원을","meaning":"支援，援助","explanation":"지원：支援，援助；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지원","audio":"/audio/0e7cfc63937a14176353.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27942","senseId":"1","lemma":"지원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지원을","audio":"/audio/e80b2acfc765772eab15.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"주었으면","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주었으면","audio":"/audio/b24497dfc8e4c2fb0366.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠는데","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠는데","audio":"/audio/149621f7ad7987921788.mp3"}},{"text":"말이지.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이지","audio":"/audio/5bfd171a130e4f49803e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"0a721569f0975a60","term":"순수","zh":"纯正，纯粹","audio":"/audio/0a721569f0975a60da82.mp3","entryId":"15795","definition":"完全不掺杂其他东西。","pronunciation":["순수"]},{"id":"efd39504d3c7a69f","term":"학문","zh":"做学问，学问，学识","audio":"/audio/efd39504d3c7a69fdd27.mp3","entryId":"84269","definition":"系统地学习、精通某领域相关知识；或指此类知识。","pronunciation":["항문"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"0e7cfc63937a1417","term":"지원","zh":"支援，援助","audio":"/audio/0e7cfc63937a14176353.mp3","entryId":"27942","definition":"以物质或劳动给予帮助。","pronunciation":["지원"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/24da7cb022d7bc1479ed.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":6.644,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=7663